A new version of My Tester is out. It allows setting base url for generating absolute URLs with Nette\Application\LinkGenerator from Nette DIC extension.

The script mytester.php has new options --bootstrap and --list-test-suites. It can also use a config file from current working directory (neither name nor location can be customized for now).

Any method in a TestCase can be now treated as a test method with attribute Test.

Nette DIC extension has new options coverage and results, they are going to replace coverageFormat and resultsFormat in the next major version.

For complete list of changes since previous version, see CHANGELOG.md.
